{"package":"GithubFS","version":"1.0.1","assessment":"complete","packageSha256":"aed513b3eba8355aed3418eba02a361593c4e5227f40033058925a8f28106027","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T22:50:19.270Z","scannerVersion":"0.2.0","rulesetVersion":"0.3.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.6.8","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0","clamav":{"engineVersion":"1.5.4","databaseVersion":"main:63,daily:28163,bytecode:339","databaseDate":"main:16 Dec 2025 23:18 +0000,daily:24 Oct 2026 06:26 +0000,bytecode:11 Sep 2025 08:29 -0400"}},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/GithubFS/1.0.1","metadata":{"title":"GithubFS","description":"# GithubFS\nA provider for powershell which uses octokit to let you use github repos as a filesystem inside powershell\n\n##Usage\nInstall the `GithubFS` PSModule to a modules directory of your choice, then import it in your profile with\n```powershell\nipmo GithubFS\n```\nAdditionally, visit github and grab a [personal access token](https://github.com/settings/tokens). (You should \nprobably give it user and repo permissions) Drop that in your profile like so:\n```powershell\n$env:GITHUB_TOKEN = '<token>';\n```\nGreat! Now once you refresh your shell you should have access to a `GH:` drive which contains all the orgs/users you\nknow about! You should be able to use it just like it was a filesystem, however not all applications are capable\nof using PSProviders for input paths.\n\n##Detail\nThe `GithubProvider` project contains a few C# classes used to bind the Github API to a PSProvider and register\nthe provider.\nThe `GithubFS` project is a powershell module which loads the `GithubProvider` and, additionally, provides a few\nuseful cmdlets for manipulating and using the github psprovider. \n\n###Provided Cmdlets\n####Out-Github\nIs a proxy to `Out-File` which knows about the Github PSProvider and polyfills support for it using `set-content`\nto recreate the unavailable stream support. It is aliased to override `Out-File` so that it polyfills support for \nshell redirections.","authors":"Wesley Wigham <wwigham@gmail.com>","owners":"weswigham","projectUrl":"https://github.com/weswigham/GithubProvider","publishedAt":"2015-05-15T18:59:35.473","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T10:00:01.497","tags":["git","github","psprovider","provider","filesystem","version","control","PSModule","PSFunction_Out-Github","PSCommand_Out-Github","PSIncludes_Function"]},"dependencies":[],"binaryArtifacts":[{"path":"bin/GithubProvider.dll","size":33792,"sha256":"fe097c666973b4ed5a72b2498547a47c44dc4f0b576c6e52d7136ffbfabeaafb","virusTotalSearchUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/search/fe097c666973b4ed5a72b2498547a47c44dc4f0b576c6e52d7136ffbfabeaafb","clamav":{"status":"clean","signature":null,"engineVersion":"1.5.4","databaseVersion":"main:63,daily:28163,bytecode:339","databaseDate":"main:16 Dec 2025 23:18 +0000,daily:24 Oct 2026 06:26 +0000,bytecode:11 Sep 2025 08:29 -0400"}},{"path":"bin/Octokit.Caching.dll","size":8192,"sha256":"aa34c678526fd547bb97f5bdcda30034b64362986dcaaa03293a159fe6898b63","virusTotalSearchUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/search/aa34c678526fd547bb97f5bdcda30034b64362986dcaaa03293a159fe6898b63","clamav":{"status":"clean","signature":null,"engineVersion":"1.5.4","databaseVersion":"main:63,daily:28163,bytecode:339","databaseDate":"main:16 Dec 2025 23:18 +0000,daily:24 Oct 2026 06:26 +0000,bytecode:11 Sep 2025 08:29 -0400"}},{"path":"bin/Octokit.dll","size":409088,"sha256":"c476db58c6aaab41eaffd82df9269db89d385009ba31caa1d15eba7a1a311b11","virusTotalSearchUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/search/c476db58c6aaab41eaffd82df9269db89d385009ba31caa1d15eba7a1a311b11","clamav":{"status":"clean","signature":null,"engineVersion":"1.5.4","databaseVersion":"main:63,daily:28163,bytecode:339","databaseDate":"main:16 Dec 2025 23:18 +0000,daily:24 Oct 2026 06:26 +0000,bytecode:11 Sep 2025 08:29 -0400"}}],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":493,"crc32":"85ed3aa8","extension":"rels"},{"path":"GithubFS.nus